   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDF 2009 - COMESA Planning grant</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PDF 2009</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDF contains a number of components which each is an activity. The main actitvities are various audits that Sida commissions like pre-award assessments, forensic audits, organisational assessments etc. In addition, some components are planning grants to partner organisations that Sida intends to start a more long-term collaboration with but that needs to develop their programme/proposal</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PDF-fil inneh&#xE5;ller ett antal komponenter som var och en &#xE4;r en aktivitet. Huvud actitvities finns olika revisioner som Sida provisioner som pre-utm&#xE4;rkelse bed&#xF6;mningar, kriminalteknisk revision, organisationsbed&#xF6;mningar etc. Dessutom &#xE4;r vissa komponenter  planeringsbidrag till partnerorganisationer som Sida har f&#xF6;r avsikt att starta ett mer l&#xE5;ngsiktigt samarbete med men som m&#xE5;ste utvecklas</narrative>
  </description>
